Let $$Z_{A_i} = \left( \left[ \mu_{A_i}^L, \mu_{A_i}^H \right], \left[ \nu_{A_i}^L, \nu_{A_i}^H \right] \right) (i = 1, 2, \cdots, n)$$ represent the comprehensive value of n attack leaf nodes, and then the integration value $$Z_i$$ of the AND node is defined as

